749
00:37:16,450 --> 00:37:18,850
How can you speak without being rude?

750
00:37:18,850 --> 00:37:19,890
Good question.

751
00:37:19,890 --> 00:37:23,290
You can use polite phrases to join the discussion.

752
00:37:23,290 --> 00:37:24,290
