917
00:43:18,710 --> 00:43:21,390
and become more confident in business situations,

918
00:43:21,390 --> 00:43:22,830
you're in the right place.

919
00:43:22,830 --> 00:43:23,830
I'm Emily.

920
00:43:23,830 --> 00:43:24,950
And I'm Jack.

921
